{
  "slug": "deploycheck",
  "name": "Deploycheck",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "DeployCheck gives Claude visibility into your deployment pipeline. Ask \"is staging ready to ship?\" and Claude will ping your health endpoints, check CI pipeline status, compare Docker image tags between environments, and show you what commits would go out. It aggregates everything into a clear go/no-go recommendation. Supports GitHub Actions and GitLab CI, configured with a simple YAML file in your project root.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `deploy-check` (Check deploy readiness across environments using the deploycheck MCP tools) and **1 MCP server**, `deploycheck`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deploycheck@claude-community` from `kawehtaher/deploycheck`.\n\nDeploy readiness checker for Claude Code. An MCP server that lets Claude verify if your environments are safe to ship — health checks, CI status, Docker tag comparison, and release diffs in one sweep.",
